{"nodes": [{"id": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_family1", "label": "Family 1 \u2014 generation-ladder diagrams", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shows the full dyadic subdivision (radius = generation depth). No stroke between cells and RADIAL_GAP=0 between generation rings -- changed 2026-10-16 because the original 1px-stroke-plus-1px-gap convention produced a visually uncomfortable dense grid of fine lines at G7/G8 density (up to 128 cells/ring, 8 rings/arc)."}, {"id": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_family2", "label": "Family 2 \u2014 full-resolution \"quick ref\" diagrams", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shows the finished primary-to-primary gradient at full resolution (257 points, G0-G8 merged and sorted by t) as one band per arc -- no stroke between cells since at 257 abutting cells a stroke rendered as washed-out moire."}, {"id": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_level1_pure_circular_filled", "label": "build_level1_pure_circular_filled.cjs", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_level3_cross_circular_filled", "label": "build_level3_cross_circular_filled.cjs", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_summary_level2_ring", "label": "build_summary_level2_ring.cjs", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_summary_rings", "label": "build_summary_rings.cjs (3-ring composite)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_polar_lib", "label": "polar_lib.cjs (shared geometry helper)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Provides polar(), annularWedgePath(), angularHalfWidthAt(), boundsSymmetric()/boundsAsymmetric(), drawArc(). Was missing from the repo until 2026-10-16 even though two committed scripts already depended on it."}, {"id": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_seam_eps_deg", "label": "SEAM_EPS_DEG angular-overlap seam fix", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Even without a stroke, adjacent flat-fill wedges don't rasterise to a perfectly shared edge -- sub-pixel rounding leaves a hairline seam that shimmers on screen. Fixed by giving every cell a tiny angular overlap with its neighbours: 0.03deg for Family 2 (confirmed small enough not to eat into the narrowest real gap, ~15x smaller), 0.08deg for Family 1 (needed larger after polar pixel-sampling showed 0.03 still left ~1% residual near-white hits at Level 2's narrower cell width)."}, {"id": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_render_scale_gotcha", "label": "RENDER_SCALE gotcha (viewBox vs CSS size mismatch)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "build_summary_rings.cjs's canvas grew from 1800 to 3000 viewBox units (to fit three rings without clipping) but its CSS render size stayed 1800px, so 1 viewBox unit renders as only 0.6 actual on-screen px. Any gap specified as a direct on-screen px target must go through an explicit RENDER_SCALE=1800/3000 correction before conversion to viewBox units, or a bare mm-based constant will be silently 0.6x too small once rendered."}, {"id": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_level2_standalone", "label": "build_level2_standalone.cjs (currently not runnable)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Depends on level2_standalone_rows.json, which was never migrated into this repo, and uses a third, different gap convention (flat WIDE_HALF=3deg between zones, linear-width SEAM_LINEAR_HALF=2.8 within a pair) that predates the Level 1+2 combo's convention."}], "edges": [{"source": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_family1", "target": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_level1_pure_circular_filled", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_family1", "target": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_level3_cross_circular_filled", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_family1", "target": "pigment_ancestry_model_readme_build_level1_level2_combo_v2", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_family1", "target": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_seam_eps_deg", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_family2", "target": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_summary_level2_ring", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_family2", "target": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_summary_rings", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_family2", "target": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_seam_eps_deg", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_summary_rings", "target": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_render_scale_gotcha", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_summary_level2_ring", "target": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_polar_lib", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_summary_rings", "target": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_polar_lib", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_level1_pure_circular_filled", "target": "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_polar_lib", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "AMBIGUOUS", "confidence_score": 0.2, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "diagram_rendering_pipeline", "label": "Diagram Rendering Pipeline (shared geometry helper)", "nodes": ["pigment_ancestry_model_readme_build_level1_level2_combo_v2", "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_polar_lib", "pigment_ancestry_model_scripts_diagrams_rendering_build_summary_rings"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "pigment-ancestry-model/scripts/diagrams/RENDERING.md"}]}